# Cursor PR title prefix (permanent — owner 2026-08-04)

**Every Pull Request opened by Cursor MUST begin with `Cursor-`.**

Examples (Claude shape — Rule 36):
- `Cursor- fix(safety): SAF-MEET-TRAIN-DRIVER-PICKER — meetings/training used limit:200 roster`
- `Cursor- fix(insurance): INS-CLAIM-LOAD-TRAILER-PICKER — ClaimCreate still Combobox+listLoads`
- `Cursor- docs(delivery): DELIVERY-METHOD-LOCKED rev G — Claude serial ship sequence`
- `Cursor- chore(guards): CLAIM-RESERVE 24xx even band`

Forbidden:
- Titles without the `Cursor-` prefix
- Soft variants (`cursor:`, `[Cursor]`, `CURSOR -`)
- Thin titles missing `fix(module): FINDING — defect` (Claude never ships those; they hide the hop)

Enforced by `scripts/verify-cursor-pr-title-prefix.mjs` (verify-step **2377**) when `GATE_PR_TITLE` is set (PR CI) or when the branch name starts with `cursor/`.

Companion: `docs/specs/STANDING-SESSION-DIRECTIVE.md` · `docs/specs/OWNER-QUALITY-COMPACT.md`.
